    "turn_text": "And on that front, obviously here in the Menacean County and Snowman County, there's the Eel River diversion that takes place that goes into the Russian River. And you've led a group of people in the Eel River basin and in the Russian River basin to try to meet together, to discuss ways to make something that works for both basins that you've caught at the two basin solution. Any thoughts on how that could result in hopefully beneficial water use for both the eel and for the rest of river.",
