  {
    "episode_id": 43939,
    "turn_file": "/shared/3/projects/podcasts/transcriptionQueue/turns/pol_appearance_episodes_interviews/4/3/43939.jsonl",
    "turn_idx": 39,
    "turn_text": "When many of those topics, polls show that the vast majority of Americans are not with the Supreme Court and the public supports Roe v. Wade. So yeah, you would hope if those congressional districts, unfortunately, some of them have been gerrymandered so severely in some of these states, it's a really stiff climb to retain the majority. But I think you're probably closer to seeing if that's possible or not. So are you somewhat optimistic?",
