    "turn_idx": 43,
    "turn_text": "Well, I think Truman is certifiably a cute cat. So good job there. Thanks. So what's it like being a member of Congress? I mean, again, you start out at local government on the water board, then the assembly for six years, but you must split your time between DC and the West Coast. That's not going to be easy on anybody. What's it like on you and your family?",
