  {
    "episode_id": 43939,
    "turn_file": "/shared/3/projects/podcasts/transcriptionQueue/turns/pol_appearance_episodes_interviews/4/3/43939.jsonl",
    "turn_idx": 44,
    "turn_text": "Well, I'll be honest with you. It's a lousy lifestyle. That part of it is not great. The toxic political climate we're in today is really unpleasant, but I don't mean to be a complainer because the offsetting great side of my job is that I am in the highest arena in politics. at a really important time. The issues that I work on are so consequential. History is being made every single day, it seems. And I get to be in the arena representing this awesome coastal district. So I am a happy warrior. I like the work I do. I am happy to deal with the burdens and lifestyle, the less than optimal lifestyle that accompanies it, because it's really rewarding to be able to do that work.",
