  {
    "episode_id": 43939,
    "turn_file": "/shared/3/projects/podcasts/transcriptionQueue/turns/pol_appearance_episodes_interviews/4/3/43939.jsonl",
    "turn_idx": 57,
    "turn_text": "It seems to be sort of an amazing transformation of the property. I mean, I remember coming down here over the years to cranes, and I actually didn't even know they had this big deck out here. And so this is, in my mind, the kind of the hidden jewel of this piece of property is this south-facing deck protected from the wind with the building on the west and the north. And then you've got this, like you said, 60 feet of dock space where boats can come up and launch. I asked kayaks anything, I guess.",
