  {
    "episode_id": 43939,
    "turn_file": "/shared/3/projects/podcasts/transcriptionQueue/turns/pol_appearance_episodes_interviews/4/3/43939.jsonl",
    "turn_idx": 61,
    "turn_text": "And just to talk a little bit about the cafe, you know, it's always interesting to see when there's a new restaurant or a cafe that opens up. And I really like the fact that you guys created a look for a niche that wasn't being met by an existing restaurant. We've got some amazing fish restaurants that have opened up in the last several years, along with the long-standing ones that have been here for years. And instead of just trying to repeat what everybody else was doing, it looked like you guys made a conscious effort to offer something totally different with the cafe and the coffee in the morning because many of these restaurants open up at lunch and dinner time. And so can you talk a little bit about the idea behind the cafe?",
