  {
    "episode_id": 43939,
    "turn_file": "/shared/3/projects/podcasts/transcriptionQueue/turns/pol_appearance_episodes_interviews/4/3/43939.jsonl",
    "turn_idx": 63,
    "turn_text": "Yeah, just being here working on the cafe as we've been working to get it open. We see a lot of people coming by asking us, what's going on? When are you opening? A couple came by and they were looking for a place to get a cup of coffee. And I had to say, well, can you come back in two weeks? Because I couldn't find a good cup of coffee anywhere in the area. We definitely feel that we're filling a niche and a need for the community and we're just grateful to be here.",
