    "turn_file": "/shared/3/projects/podcasts/transcriptionQueue/turns/pol_appearance_episodes_interviews/4/3/43939.jsonl",
    "turn_idx": 82,
    "turn_text": "And one thing I know you had earlier spoke with representative Huffman and I did want to mention that that's how a lot of the programs we can do down here are help right now there's an appropriations bill that we have some funding in there for that we there was kind of a round where presentations were made to his office and ours was when the one selected and we made it past the first round with that and that would really help with some of the research programs that Lynn was touching our earlier down here. So, you know, support comes from a lot of different areas and it helps to have people that are kind of looking out for their local community and wanting to find ways to help us kind of get that next step of really doing that climate science and preservation that this region really needs.",
